Comment: 0,0:23:27.44,0:23:30.61,EDR,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k57}sa{\k260}a
Comment: 0,0:22:30.07,0:22:32.51,EDE,,0,0,0,karaoke,Nothing, I know nothing
Comment: 0,0:22:32.87,0:22:34.84,EDE,,0,0,0,karaoke,inside my precious garden.
Comment: 0,0:22:35.24,0:22:39.32,EDE,,0,0,0,karaoke,I'm spraying water again today beneath the same sky.
Comment: 0,0:22:39.73,0:22:44.47,EDE,,0,0,0,karaoke,I'm pretending not to see the tricks and lies
Comment: 0,0:22:44.85,0:22:48.93,EDE,,0,0,0,karaoke,as my flowers fail to bloom.
Comment: 0,0:22:49.63,0:22:53.75,EDE,,0,0,0,karaoke,The clouds rolled on the moment I met you.
Comment: 0,0:22:54.46,0:22:58.56,EDE,,0,0,0,karaoke,The scene was like a neverending dream.
Comment: 0,0:22:59.14,0:23:01.09,EDE,,0,0,0,karaoke,I haven't much faith,
Comment: 0,0:23:01.38,0:23:03.74,EDE,,0,0,0,karaoke,but I want to hold onto
Comment: 0,0:23:04.06,0:23:07.43,EDE,,0,0,0,karaoke,the reason I want to cry.
Comment: 0,0:23:08.18,0:23:10.83,EDE,,0,0,0,karaoke,More, show me more.
Comment: 0,0:23:10.94,0:23:13.29,EDE,,0,0,0,karaoke,My armor is melting away.
Comment: 0,0:23:13.66,0:23:17.58,EDE,,0,0,0,karaoke,I want to catch the wind as it blows toward me.
Comment: 0,0:23:17.79,0:23:20.44,EDE,,0,0,0,karaoke,Our overlapping timelines
Comment: 0,0:23:20.56,0:23:22.84,EDE,,0,0,0,karaoke,are like matching heartbeats.
Comment: 0,0:23:23.24,0:23:25.19,EDE,,0,0,0,karaoke,I can take my first breath
Comment: 0,0:23:25.36,0:23:27.05,EDE,,0,0,0,karaoke,in this shaky world.
Comment: 0,0:23:27.44,0:23:30.61,EDE,,0,0,0,karaoke,Come on.
