Dialogue: 30,0:00:23.46,0:00:26.38,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}Where am I?
Dialogue: 30,0:00:28.22,0:00:30.88,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,S-Shackles?! On my legs, too?!
Dialogue: 30,0:00:33.12,0:00:34.81,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,And a collar?
Dialogue: 30,0:00:37.98,0:00:39.42,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 30,0:00:39.42,0:00:40.90,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,It seems I've
Dialogue: 30,0:00:41.71,0:00:43.76,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,been taken prisoner.
Dialogue: 30,0:00:45.27,0:00:47.26,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Defeated by mere barbarians...
Dialogue: 30,0:01:33.98,0:01:35.83,Dialogue,Illdoren Commander,0,0,0,,Rifle brigade, take your positions!
Dialogue: 30,0:01:38.83,0:01:40.33,Dialogue,Illdoren Commander,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 30,0:01:44.83,0:01:45.84,Dialogue,Illdoren Commander,0,0,0,,Keep firing!
Dialogue: 30,0:01:48.71,0:01:51.67,Dialogue,Illodren Lieutenant,0,0,0,,Captain! The barbarians\Nare putting up fierce resistance!
Dialogue: 30,0:01:51.67,0:01:53.16,Dialogue,Illodren Lieutenant,0,0,0,,The volunteer troops have been wiped out,
Dialogue: 30,0:01:53.16,0:01:55.09,Dialogue,Illodren Lieutenant,0,0,0,,and the front line of our left wing has collapsed!
Dialogue: 30,0:01:55.46,0:01:58.60,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Compose yourself! Are you not a knight \Nof Illodren's Eastern Expedition?!
Dialogue: 30,0:01:59.36,0:02:01.01,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Have the left wing retreat!
Dialogue: 30,0:02:01.01,0:02:04.89,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Expand the center and right outward \Ninto a partial wing formation!
Dialogue: 30,0:02:04.89,0:02:09.23,Dialogue,Serafina,850,5,0,,We'll deflect their attacks \Nand begin a fighting retreat!
Dialogue: 30,0:02:18.56,0:02:21.18,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}Still, even if we manage to break through,
Dialogue: 30,0:02:21.18,0:02:23.25,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}we've lost too many of our main forces.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:23.25,0:02:27.09,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}Any more losses will hurt \Nour chances of making it home.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:27.09,0:02:31.26,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}This will be the end of the seven-year \N17th Eastern Expedition...
Dialogue: 30,0:02:31.26,0:02:34.85,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,I have to get as many of my comrades \Nhome alive as I can.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:55.97,0:02:57.88,Dialogue,Veor,600,5,0,,That crystal helmet...
Dialogue: 30,0:02:57.88,0:03:00.08,Dialogue,Veor,600,5,0,,So you're the Eastern Expedition's general?
Dialogue: 30,0:03:00.08,0:03:04.57,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,I'm tired of fighting mere foot soldiers.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:04.57,0:03:06.83,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,Will you face me one-on-one?
Dialogue: 30,0:03:07.68,0:03:10.34,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}Of all times for one of their elites to appear...
Dialogue: 30,0:03:11.00,0:03:14.59,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}But if I ignore someone whose blade \Ncan tear through plate like paper,
Dialogue: 30,0:03:14.59,0:03:16.32,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}our withdrawal will fail.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:17.34,0:03:19.00,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is this overconfidence?
Dialogue: 30,0:03:19.00,0:03:21.32,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}If they're willing to fight me one-on-one,
Dialogue: 30,0:03:21.32,0:03:22.35,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have no reason to refuse.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:22.88,0:03:23.68,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Lieutenant!
Dialogue: 30,0:03:23.68,0:03:24.60,Dialogue,Lieutenant,0,0,0,,Y-Yes?!
Dialogue: 30,0:03:25.15,0:03:27.48,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Numbers won't help us against that one.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:27.48,0:03:29.04,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,You take command here.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:29.04,0:03:32.36,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Tell my brother I gave my life for our homeland!
Dialogue: 30,0:03:58.84,0:04:00.36,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}Princess Wysteresia!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.36,0:04:03.01,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}Please, lend me your strength!
Dialogue: 30,0:04:20.43,0:04:22.49,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is as far as I go...
Dialogue: 30,0:04:22.49,0:04:27.00,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,Well done. Few have stood against me\Nfor as long as you have.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:29.12,0:04:29.73,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Kill me!
Dialogue: 30,0:04:29.73,0:04:30.62,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,I refuse.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:33.33,0:04:35.94,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,Instead, you will be mine.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:36.34,0:04:40.71,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,Fear not. Your survival isn't in question.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:40.71,0:04:45.20,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,Not when I have plans for that body.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:52.11,0:04:58.65,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's right... I was... \Ntaken as his spoils.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:59.34,0:05:03.18,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}W-Will they put me to work \Nin the fields, like livestock?
Dialogue: 30,0:05:03.18,0:05:08.16,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}No... They'll probably torture me first \Nto get what they want...
Dialogue: 30,0:05:08.16,0:05:13.16,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}They took me alive.\NThere must be a reason for it.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:14.74,0:05:18.30,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,Not when I have plans for that body.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:20.10,0:05:23.00,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,I-I hate to even think it...
Dialogue: 30,0:05:23.00,0:05:26.22,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,but if I was captured \Nbecause I'm a woman...
Dialogue: 30,0:05:30.18,0:05:32.55,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Will they make sport of me?!
Dialogue: 30,0:05:35.24,0:05:38.64,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,What a disgraceful fate \Nfor an unmarried noblewoman!
Dialogue: 30,0:05:38.64,0:05:42.20,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Am I in a den of animals?!
Dialogue: 30,0:05:42.88,0:05:46.87,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,And what of the troops \Nwho swore to fight for me?!
Dialogue: 30,0:05:47.70,0:05:49.78,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}The time I bought them
Dialogue: 30,0:05:49.78,0:05:53.43,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}can't have been enough \Nfor an orderly retreat!
Dialogue: 30,0:05:53.43,0:05:55.28,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}Even if the rear escaped,
Dialogue: 30,0:05:55.28,0:05:57.84,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}the front lines would have \Nbeen torn apart...
Dialogue: 30,0:05:59.82,0:06:03.59,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}Either cut down \Nor left to die in the wilds...
Dialogue: 30,0:06:05.60,0:06:07.85,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}But more pressing than that...
Dialogue: 30,0:06:12.41,0:06:15.98,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}Without control of the eastern lands,
Dialogue: 30,0:06:16.55,0:06:18.56,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}where the barbarians rule,
Dialogue: 30,0:06:26.99,0:06:31.45,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,I failed to protect the people's livelihood...\NThe very duty of a noble...
Dialogue: 30,0:06:32.81,0:06:34.91,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,You're taking the "noble" \Npart of your title quite literally.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:37.43,0:06:38.75,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Who are you?!
Dialogue: 30,0:06:41.07,0:06:42.67,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,My name is Cersei.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.67,0:06:46.01,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,I serve the man who captured you.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:49.31,0:06:51.02,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:52.28,0:06:55.22,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Are you here to extract information?
Dialogue: 30,0:06:55.67,0:06:57.41,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,Information?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.41,0:06:59.30,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 30,0:07:00.48,0:07:02.61,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Don't play dumb, barbarian!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:02.61,0:07:07.72,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,You're here to use those strange devices\Nto make me talk, aren't you?!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:07.72,0:07:11.24,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,I was only given one order.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:12.22,0:07:14.14,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,To ensure that you, his prize,
Dialogue: 30,0:07:14.14,0:07:17.00,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,are in a condition that is to his liking.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:17.33,0:07:18.51,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Prize...?
Dialogue: 30,0:07:23.87,0:07:25.97,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:25.97,0:07:29.53,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,Isn't it obvious? It'll be harder \Nif you're able to struggle.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:32.49,0:07:34.61,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}So, it begins...
Dialogue: 30,0:07:34.61,0:07:38.88,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}These restraints...\NHow far will they go with this?
Dialogue: 30,0:07:38.88,0:07:40.61,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}Even so, I...
Dialogue: 30,0:07:41.76,0:07:44.32,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}will not yield to torture!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:49.62,0:07:52.87,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,She should be awake by now...
Dialogue: 30,0:07:54.05,0:07:56.54,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,My prize.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:07.72,0:08:09.28,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.28,0:08:11.76,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}What is going on?
Dialogue: 30,0:08:16.53,0:08:19.52,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,There. You're much cleaner now.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:19.52,0:08:22.17,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Seriously, what are you doing?!
Dialogue: 30,0:08:22.17,0:08:24.49,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,What did you expect me to say?
Dialogue: 30,0:08:24.49,0:08:28.16,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,I was wiping the blood and filth off you.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:28.16,0:08:29.97,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,Honestly, you were a mess.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:29.97,0:08:30.78,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 30,0:08:30.78,0:08:36.29,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,And I have to say, I heard\Nyou traded blows with my master...
Dialogue: 30,0:08:37.33,0:08:42.29,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,I expected someone more brutish, \Nbut you're actually...
Dialogue: 30,0:08:44.27,0:08:48.24,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,Even from another woman's perspective, \Nyou have quite a feminine figure.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:49.09,0:08:52.83,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Are you mocking me?! \NA knight has no need for femininity!
Dialogue: 30,0:08:52.83,0:08:53.85,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 30,0:08:53.85,0:08:56.67,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,Well, what you think doesn't really matter.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:56.67,0:09:00.35,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,What matters is that you've caught his eye.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:01.46,0:09:03.42,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 30,0:09:03.42,0:09:06.09,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,Would it really make \Nany difference if I told you?
Dialogue: 30,0:09:06.54,0:09:07.61,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:07.61,0:09:10.61,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,Nothing would change, even if I did.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:10.61,0:09:13.49,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,You're never leaving this place again.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:15.24,0:09:18.25,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Then... you really are here to...
Dialogue: 30,0:09:19.16,0:09:21.92,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,Now, for the finishing touches.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:29.01,0:09:30.93,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is this the end for me?
Dialogue: 30,0:09:48.74,0:09:50.28,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,What are these clothes?
Dialogue: 30,0:09:51.09,0:09:54.09,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}So she wasn't here to \Ninterrogate or torture me?
Dialogue: 30,0:09:57.38,0:09:59.34,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}This scent...
Dialogue: 30,0:09:59.34,0:10:01.63,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}Who puts scented oil on a prisoner of war?
Dialogue: 30,0:10:02.38,0:10:04.92,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}But that's not the real question here:
Dialogue: 30,0:10:04.92,0:10:08.30,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}What am I being prepared for?
Dialogue: 30,0:10:09.27,0:10:10.23,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,Now then,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.61,0:10:13.05,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,I'd say you're finally presentable.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:13.57,0:10:17.75,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is this some kind of\Nbarbarian ritual for prisoners?
Dialogue: 30,0:10:18.94,0:10:20.31,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't tell me—
Dialogue: 30,0:10:23.31,0:10:25.82,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,What was that?! Thunder?
Dialogue: 30,0:10:25.82,0:10:28.82,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,No, that shout could belong to no one else.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:31.97,0:10:33.48,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,So it's him.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:43.08,0:10:45.08,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,Well, now...
Dialogue: 30,0:10:45.08,0:10:49.36,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,It's like night and day, Crystal Helmet.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:02.60,0:11:06.33,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,We had no chance\Nto exchange names during the battle...
Dialogue: 30,0:11:06.33,0:11:10.39,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,I am the heir to Great Chief Uldyn One Eye,
Dialogue: 30,0:11:10.39,0:11:12.79,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,Thundering Voice Veor.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:12.79,0:11:15.86,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}Seeing him again like this, \Nhe's absolutely enormous!
Dialogue: 30,0:11:16.44,0:11:18.73,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}And those golden eyes...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.73,0:11:20.87,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}He can't be human.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:20.87,0:11:24.68,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,I see what you people are after...
Dialogue: 30,0:11:28.24,0:11:32.54,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,My grandfather told me of the Eastern Expedition \Ntwenty years ago, when he took part in it...
Dialogue: 30,0:11:33.08,0:11:35.29,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,It sounded like a fairy tale,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.29,0:11:36.89,Dialogue,Seafina,0,0,0,,but now I see the truth.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:45.42,0:11:48.15,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Those inhuman eyes tell me everything!
Dialogue: 30,0:11:49.36,0:11:52.94,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,I am a Margrave for Lavillant,\Nof the Kingdom of Illdoren,
Dialogue: 30,0:11:52.94,0:11:55.00,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,youngest daughter\Nof the former lord, Mattius,
Dialogue: 30,0:11:55.00,0:11:57.22,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,commander of the First Company \Nof the Eastern Expeditionary Force,
Dialogue: 30,0:11:57.22,0:11:58.62,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Serafina de Lavillant!
Dialogue: 30,0:12:00.24,0:12:03.02,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,And I have no intention of begging for mercy!
Dialogue: 30,0:12:03.02,0:12:05.50,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,If this is some sacrifice, \Nthen do with me as you will!
Dialogue: 30,0:12:10.79,0:12:12.11,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.11,0:12:16.18,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}No matter what happens to me, \NI can at least keep my dignity!
Dialogue: 30,0:12:16.18,0:12:17.87,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,Serafina...
Dialogue: 30,0:12:17.87,0:12:20.80,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,Sera, then. A fine name.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:20.80,0:12:22.79,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,That said, Sera,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.79,0:12:25.60,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,what's this about a sacrifice?
Dialogue: 30,0:12:27.10,0:12:31.61,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,I brought you here to make you my bride.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:38.39,0:12:41.07,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,B-Bride?! Whose?!
Dialogue: 30,0:12:41.07,0:12:42.10,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,Mine.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:42.10,0:12:42.75,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 30,0:12:42.75,0:12:43.71,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,Mine.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:43.71,0:12:44.83,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,I've never heard of such a thing!
Dialogue: 30,0:12:46.38,0:12:48.05,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,You can't fool me!
Dialogue: 30,0:12:48.05,0:12:51.75,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,You're just trying to lower my guard \Nso you can use me in some bizarre ritual!
Dialogue: 30,0:12:51.75,0:12:55.23,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,If that were my plan, why wait this long?
Dialogue: 30,0:12:55.94,0:12:59.02,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,B-But aren't we enemies?!
Dialogue: 30,0:12:59.02,0:13:00.96,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,Who says you can't marry your enemy?
Dialogue: 30,0:13:00.96,0:13:02.47,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Everyone!
Dialogue: 30,0:13:02.47,0:13:07.67,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,Well, that may be true in the west,\Nbut we do things differently here.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:07.67,0:13:08.85,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 30,0:13:10.17,0:13:13.78,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,For generations, my clan...
Dialogue: 30,0:13:15.11,0:13:19.55,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,has upheld the tradition of\Ntaking lady knights as our brides!
Dialogue: 30,0:13:23.26,0:13:26.62,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}Th-This is insane!
Dialogue: 30,0:13:27.21,0:13:30.75,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Do you really think that absurd logic\Nis enough to convince me?!
Dialogue: 30,0:13:30.75,0:13:31.75,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,It's not?
Dialogue: 30,0:13:31.75,0:13:34.08,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Of course not!
Dialogue: 30,0:13:34.08,0:13:39.29,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,You already said I could do as I pleased with you.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:41.10,0:13:43.37,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,Or was that just talk?
Dialogue: 30,0:13:44.56,0:13:46.01,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}I was careless!
Dialogue: 30,0:13:46.87,0:13:52.52,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,That said, I'm not making this choice \Nout of respect for law or tradition.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:52.52,0:13:55.65,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,When we crossed swords, \NI saw your worth at once.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:57.03,0:14:01.57,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,A sword speaks louder than a thousand words.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:01.57,0:14:05.90,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,I felt a profound sincerity in your blade.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:09.23,0:14:11.29,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,I fell for you then and there.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:12.83,0:14:13.64,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Fall...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.69,0:14:15.98,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,for...?
Dialogue: 30,0:14:18.48,0:14:20.94,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,That being the case,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.94,0:14:23.89,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,you won't be taken against your will, so relax.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:24.64,0:14:26.30,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,We'll speak again later, Sera.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:30.89,0:14:32.06,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,W-Wait a moment!
Dialogue: 30,0:14:33.77,0:14:36.50,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Wh-What...
Dialogue: 30,0:14:37.57,0:14:40.98,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,What is going on here?!
Dialogue: 30,0:14:40.98,0:14:44.18,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,You're being courted, if it wasn't obvious.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:58.62,0:15:01.13,Dialogue,Sidius,0,0,0,,The king has issued his orders.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:02.81,0:15:05.64,Dialogue,Sidius,0,0,0,,The 17th Eastern Expedition \Nis to begin.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:07.82,0:15:10.23,Dialogue,Sidius,5,600,0,,My sister, Serafina...
Dialogue: 30,0:15:10.23,0:15:12.89,Dialogue,Sidius,5,600,0,,You have been named\Ncaptain of the First Company.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:16.41,0:15:19.40,Dialogue,Sidius,0,0,0,,Win glory worthy of the Lavillant name.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:19.40,0:15:20.53,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,I will!
Dialogue: 30,0:15:23.17,0:15:23.96,Dialogue,Sidius,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:27.08,0:15:31.29,Dialogue,Sidius,0,0,0,,This is an invitation to a banquet \Nfrom Countess Ildhal.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:31.72,0:15:33.29,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,What of it?
Dialogue: 30,0:15:34.83,0:15:37.79,Dialogue,Sidius,0,0,0,,Well, it was addressed to {\i1}Princess{\i0} Serafina.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:42.03,0:15:44.05,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,I will attend, of course.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:50.81,0:15:52.74,Dialogue,Merchant,0,0,0,,Stop that thief!
Dialogue: 30,0:15:53.37,0:15:55.49,Dialogue,Citizens,0,0,0,,Sounds like it pays well.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:55.49,0:15:59.24,Dialogue,Citizens,0,0,0,,I'm scared, though... A friend of mine \Nwho signed up never came back.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:59.24,0:16:01.32,Dialogue,Citizens,0,0,0,,An expedition to the east?
Dialogue: 30,0:16:01.32,0:16:03.71,Dialogue,Citizens,0,0,0,,I'm gonna join the volunteer army!
Dialogue: 30,0:16:05.04,0:16:07.57,Dialogue,Citizens,0,0,0,,Hey, it's the Lavillants' carriage!
Dialogue: 30,0:16:28.88,0:16:31.59,Dialogue,Noble Man,0,0,0,,My, what a rare guest we have.
Dialogue: 30,0:16:31.59,0:16:33.47,Dialogue,Noble Lady,0,0,0,,She certainly is.
Dialogue: 30,0:16:35.96,0:16:39.02,Dialogue,Nobles,0,0,0,,The quality of the food has been dreadful lately.
Dialogue: 30,0:16:39.02,0:16:42.32,Dialogue,Nobles,0,0,0,,But the longer the war drags on, \Nthe more we profit from it.
Dialogue: 30,0:16:42.32,0:16:43.49,Dialogue,Nobles,0,0,0,,Indeed...
Dialogue: 30,0:16:46.03,0:16:49.36,Dialogue,Noble Man 1,0,0,0,,Princess Serafina certainly cuts an impressive figure.
Dialogue: 30,0:16:50.03,0:16:53.21,Dialogue,Noble Woman 1,0,0,0,,She's more gallant than beautiful.
Dialogue: 30,0:16:54.04,0:16:55.68,Dialogue,Knight 1,0,0,0,,Someone like that, commanding knights...
Dialogue: 30,0:16:55.68,0:16:57.52,Dialogue,Knight 2,0,0,0,,What a state of affairs.
Dialogue: 30,0:16:57.52,0:16:59.40,Dialogue,Knight 2,0,0,0,,Imagine being led by a woman.
Dialogue: 30,0:16:59.40,0:17:03.29,Dialogue,Knight 1,0,0,0,,That said, she is among\Nthe strongest in the order.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:03.29,0:17:07.20,Dialogue,Knight 1,0,0,0,,And it's only natural for a Lavillant \Nto command an army, but...
Dialogue: 30,0:17:07.20,0:17:09.82,Dialogue,Knight 1,0,0,0,,What's the point of a woman being strong?
Dialogue: 30,0:17:18.28,0:17:19.74,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,I want to go home.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:20.58,0:17:22.06,Dialogue,Acquaintance 1,0,0,0,,Lady Serafina.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:22.61,0:17:26.07,Dialogue,Acquaintance 1,0,0,0,,There you are. We've been looking for you.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:26.07,0:17:28.29,Dialogue,Acquaintance 2,0,0,0,,You shouldn't be out here alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.29,0:17:30.11,Dialogue,Acquaintance 2,0,0,0,,Please, come join us.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:31.76,0:17:34.74,Dialogue,Acquaintance 1,0,0,0,,It's been so long. \NI wonder how many years it's been.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:34.74,0:17:39.40,Dialogue,Acquaintance 2,0,0,0,,I heard you were named commander \Nfor the Eastern Expedition?
Dialogue: 30,0:17:39.40,0:17:40.31,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:40.31,0:17:41.89,Dialogue,Acquaintance 1,0,0,0,,How dreadful!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.89,0:17:46.75,Dialogue,Acquaintance 1,0,0,0,,Isn't the east full of violent, \Nunknowable creatures?
Dialogue: 30,0:17:46.75,0:17:50.39,Dialogue,Acquaintance 2,0,0,0,,Rumors speak of fire-breathing \Ndragons and other monsters.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:50.39,0:17:53.08,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Dragons and monsters are the stuff of fables.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:53.08,0:17:56.04,Dialogue,Acquaintance 1,0,0,0,,Even so, it will still be dangerous.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:56.04,0:17:59.02,Dialogue,Acquaintance 1,0,0,0,,Since you're going to fight the barbarians...
Dialogue: 30,0:17:59.02,0:18:03.15,Dialogue,Acquaintance 1,0,0,0,,Aren't they said to be more like \Nbeasts in human form?
Dialogue: 30,0:18:03.15,0:18:06.24,Dialogue,Acuqaintence 2,0,0,0,,And they kidnap lady knights \Nto use them as sacrifices!
Dialogue: 30,0:18:06.24,0:18:08.96,Dialogue,Acquaintance 1,0,0,0,,If the eastern lands really are that terrible,
Dialogue: 30,0:18:08.96,0:18:11.32,Dialogue,Acquaintance 1,0,0,0,,no woman should ever set foot there.
Dialogue: 30,0:18:14.40,0:18:16.39,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Conquering the east
Dialogue: 30,0:18:16.39,0:18:19.16,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,has been the goal of the Kingdom\Nof Illdoren since its founding...
Dialogue: 30,0:18:19.79,0:18:23.06,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,As a member of the nobility, \Nit is an honor to be sent there
Dialogue: 30,0:18:23.06,0:18:25.63,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,for the sake of the people and their peace!
Dialogue: 30,0:18:26.71,0:18:29.81,Dialogue,Acquaintance 1,0,0,0,,You should leave that sort of thing to the men.
Dialogue: 30,0:18:29.81,0:18:33.21,Dialogue,Acquaintance 1,0,0,0,,What good could possibly come \Nof a woman fighting?
Dialogue: 30,0:18:33.21,0:18:35.89,Dialogue,Acquaintance 1,0,0,0,,Even Princess Wysteresia, \Nwhom you admired so much,
Dialogue: 30,0:18:35.89,0:18:38.68,Dialogue,Acquaintance 1,0,0,0,,ended up going missing on the battlefield.
Dialogue: 30,0:18:39.21,0:18:41.58,Dialogue,Acquaintance 1,0,0,0,,There is no greater happiness for a woman
Dialogue: 30,0:18:41.58,0:18:43.18,Dialogue,Acquaintance 1,0,0,0,,than marrying and tending a household.
Dialogue: 30,0:18:50.90,0:18:53.02,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,They have it so easy.
Dialogue: 30,0:18:53.83,0:18:56.80,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,A grand feast\Naccompanied by lively music...
Dialogue: 30,0:19:01.76,0:19:05.72,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}While the people only grow hungrier, \Nas our crops continue to fail...
Dialogue: 30,0:19:05.72,0:19:08.09,Dialogue,Merchant,0,0,0,,{\an8}S-Someone, help!
Dialogue: 30,0:19:15.31,0:19:16.59,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 30,0:19:18.56,0:19:21.52,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Resist, and I won't spare your lives.
Dialogue: 30,0:19:23.05,0:19:24.75,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}These people are...
Dialogue: 30,0:19:27.81,0:19:29.39,Dialogue,Bandit 1,0,0,0,,That sword... She's a noble.
Dialogue: 30,0:19:29.39,0:19:32.42,Dialogue,Bandit 2,0,0,0,,I-It don't matter! We gotta do this!
Dialogue: 30,0:19:41.49,0:19:45.08,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,This is your first time\Nresorting to something like this, isn't it?
Dialogue: 30,0:19:46.28,0:19:48.08,Dialogue,Bandit 1,0,0,0,,It's better than starving to death!
Dialogue: 30,0:19:48.08,0:19:49.84,Dialogue,Bandit 2,0,0,0,,You'd never understand!
Dialogue: 30,0:20:00.10,0:20:02.52,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,And you'll never do this again?
Dialogue: 30,0:20:02.52,0:20:04.61,Dialogue,Bandit 1,0,0,0,,W-We can really take it?
Dialogue: 30,0:20:04.61,0:20:05.52,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 30,0:20:06.29,0:20:07.72,Dialogue,Bandit 1,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 30,0:20:07.72,0:20:10.26,Dialogue,Bandit 2,0,0,0,,I'll be able to feed my child!
Dialogue: 30,0:20:11.38,0:20:13.61,Dialogue,Bandit 1,0,0,0,,We'll never do it again.
Dialogue: 30,0:20:14.55,0:20:15.52,Dialogue,Bandit 1,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 30,0:20:15.52,0:20:16.47,Dialogue,Bandit 2,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 30,0:20:18.62,0:20:20.16,Dialogue,Bandit 3,0,0,0,,We really owe her...
Dialogue: 30,0:20:20.16,0:20:21.62,Dialogue,Bandit 2,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 30,0:20:22.86,0:20:25.10,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}Just hold on a little longer.
Dialogue: 30,0:20:25.10,0:20:27.27,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}I will conquer the east
Dialogue: 30,0:20:28.75,0:20:31.88,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}so all of you can live better lives.
Dialogue: 30,0:20:39.57,0:20:40.89,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,I take my leave now.
Dialogue: 30,0:20:41.41,0:20:45.86,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,I will fight with all I have\Nfor the people and for the kingdom.
Dialogue: 30,0:20:45.86,0:20:46.89,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Please, watch over me...
Dialogue: 30,0:20:49.25,0:20:50.57,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Princess Wysteresia.
Dialogue: 30,0:20:50.57,0:20:51.57,Dialogue,Sidius,0,0,0,,Serafina.
Dialogue: 30,0:20:54.98,0:20:56.15,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Brother...
Dialogue: 30,0:20:56.76,0:20:59.91,Dialogue,Sidius,0,0,0,,Did you fail to find a husband again at the party?
Dialogue: 30,0:20:59.91,0:21:00.93,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 30,0:21:00.93,0:21:03.92,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,What are you saying? \NI was just about to head out—
Dialogue: 30,0:21:03.92,0:21:04.53,Dialogue,Sidius,0,0,0,,Silence.
Dialogue: 30,0:21:05.41,0:21:07.78,Dialogue,Sidius,0,0,0,,A woman wanting to be a knight?
Dialogue: 30,0:21:07.78,0:21:10.02,Dialogue,Sidius,0,0,0,,How long will you cling to this selfishness?
Dialogue: 30,0:21:10.02,0:21:11.39,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,What are you saying...?
Dialogue: 30,0:21:11.39,0:21:14.14,Dialogue,Sidius,0,0,0,,You've already more than proven yourself.
Dialogue: 30,0:21:14.14,0:21:16.67,Dialogue,Sidius,0,0,0,,You need to marry while \Nthere are still suitable prospects.
Dialogue: 30,0:21:16.67,0:21:18.78,Dialogue,Sidius,0,0,0,,A sword has never changed policy.
Dialogue: 30,0:21:18.78,0:21:21.36,Dialogue,Sidius,0,0,0,,Sera...
Dialogue: 30,0:21:21.36,0:21:26.43,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,Sera... Sera... Sera!
Dialogue: 30,0:21:26.43,0:21:30.19,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,Be my bride!
Dialogue: 30,0:21:30.19,0:21:32.19,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Wh-What the—?!
Dialogue: 30,0:21:32.19,0:21:37.19,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,You will be my bride!
Dialogue: 30,0:21:43.22,0:21:44.43,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,A dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.43,0:21:47.30,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,About that barbarian? But why?
Dialogue: 30,0:21:51.30,0:21:54.02,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,What is that... sound?
